e}},{"type":"text","text":"API开放平台","styles":{"bold":true,"textColor":"red"}},{"type":"text","text":"”，如下图所示（别告诉我就在中间也找不到，实在不行让ds给你网址好吧）","styles":{"bold":true}}]},{"type":"image","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","url":"assets/94243b62-17e7-4563-9383-77f4f19438c9.jpg","name":"AB38206F262334C550FB6E1C71280B44.jpg","caption":"","showPreview":true},"id":"cd2a68c4-edc1-49b6-8836-e062279d81a9"},{"type":"paragraph","props":{"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"id":"ea358e7c-d84f-49b7-9031-2f2b10ae5046","content":[{"type":"text","text":"STEP III  ","styles":{"bold":true,"underline":true,"textColor":"pink","backgroundColor":"pink"}}]},{"type":"paragraph","props":{"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"id":"7311a651-bb9f-4843-bc70-d8e0d4a58d09","content":[{"type":"text","text":"然后到","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":"充值","styles":{"bold":true,"textColor":"red"}},{"type":"text","text":"界面去氪金一下。氪多少随便你。","styles":{"bold":true}}]},{"type":"paragraph","props":{"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"id":"308fe706-25b3-4be7-865e-ab7ab899b000","content":[{"type":"text","text":"接着去","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":"API keys","styles":{"bold":true,"textColor":"red"}},{"type":"text","text":"界面，如下图所示，创建key（s），（记得c+v一下，就只会显示一次，但是没有复制上也没关系，再创建一个就好，反正能创建几百个来着，旧的那个你删掉留着都行。注意：","styles":{"bold":true}},{"type":"text","text":"不要把自己的key交给别人！","styles":{"bold":true,"backgroundColor":"yellow"}},{"type":"text","text":"这毕竟是和钱联系的东西。此外我推荐一个harness之类的用一个，或者说有分类意思，不管这个也行，看你心情。）","styles":{"bold":true}}]},{"type":"paragraph","props":{"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"id":"b8a81349-127b-4481-84ab-772b8808862b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"（不过目前你不去用key也可以，因为有dsh可以直接登录ds账号，直接从你账号上的金额扣钱）","styles":{"bold":true}}]},{"type":"paragraph","props":{"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"id":"86a7e5ce-2869-4366-bdb6-ed2a9c025d62","content":[]},{"type":"paragraph","props":{"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"id":"b2a8f88b-fdcb-4f21-8dc3-b20ddb6f9981","content":[]},{"type":"image","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","url":"assets/bdfff1af-0cca-4c1d-b7d6-d91cbafeb2a1.jpg","name":"54B5703C874BE24BCB86E19F67248CA1.png","caption":"","showPreview":true},"id":"b696c316-7fc7-45f7-a9ce-2e1b7088b1af"}],"text":"本文档将使用DeepSeek（以下简称ds）搭配DeepSeek（以下简称dsh）进行演示如何使用一个harness并开始你的项目。\n\n\n\n\nSTEP I  \n找到ds的官方网页，并进入。官网我会放在下面。（真的服了，有些浏览器会给你一堆垃圾网页，不显示你真正要找的，给我看力竭了。）                                                                                      \n\nDeepSeek | 深度求索\n\n\n（截止到截图时间2026年10月17号ds官方网页如上图所示）\n\n\nSTEP II  \n进入“API开放平台”，如下图所示（别告诉我就在中间也找不到，实在不行让ds给你网址好吧）\n\nSTEP III  \n然后到充值界面去氪金一下。氪多少随便你。\n接着去API keys界面，如下图所示，创建key（s），（记得c+v一下，就只会显示一次，但是没有复制上也没关系，再创建一个就好，反正能创建几百个来着，旧的那个你删掉留着都行。注意：不要把自己的key交给别人！这毕竟是和钱联系的东西。此外我推荐一个harness之类的用一个，或者说有分类意思，不管这个也行，看你心情。）\n（不过目前你不去用key也可以，因为有dsh可以直接登录ds账号，直接从你账号上的金额扣钱）\n\n\n"},{"id":"c71e0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005","title":"Claude Opus","parentId":null,"position":5,"kind":"reference","version":1,"publishedAt":"2026-10-17T09:54:13.442Z","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","props":{},"content":[]},{"type":"linkCard","props":{"title":"Claude Opus","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/opus-5-5/overview"}}],"text":"\nClaude Opus https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/opus-5-5/overview"},{"id":"1954556a-247c-4e3c-a436-96a3969bebdd","title":"DSH（DeepSeekHarness）","parentId":"f3d29edd-ce5d-43f5-9cda-e61ca8038704","position":5,"kind":"document","version":3,"updatedAt":"2026-10-17T09:13:57.666Z","publishedAt":"2026-10-17T10:42:52.362Z","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","props":{"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"id":"d95c2454-5cdc-4f9c-9319-c51bb1565e09","content":[{"type":"text","text":"直接参考example","styles":{}